     "stem": "What does the woman say the arts can do?",
     "stemZh": "这位女士认为人文艺术能够做什么?\nA)\n建设繁荣的国家。\nB)\n培养技术熟练的专业人才。\nC)\n造就才华横溢的艺术家。\nD)\n培养更好的公民。",
     "answer": "D （细节题） Cultivate better citizens.",
     "evidence": "P9\nStudying literature or music or sculpture might not result in a job in that area, but it helps young people to think about the world in a deeper way, which makes them better citizens and makes for a better society.\n学习文学、音乐或雕塑，也许不会带来该领域的工作，但它能帮助年轻人更深入地思考世界，从而让他们成为更好的公民、造就更好的社会。",
