     "stemZh": "说话者说1872年4月10日发生了什么?\nA)\nJulius Morton获得了一项特别奖励。\nB)\n整个Nebraska州种植了一百万棵树。\nC)\n州政府宣布这一天为正式的植树节。\nD)\nNebraska获得了\"植树者之州\"的昵称。",
     "answer": "B （细节题） One million trees were planted throughout Nebraska.",
     "evidence": "P3\nAnd on April 10, 1872, the first unofficial Arbor Day was celebrated throughout Nebraska. Prizes were awarded to counties, cities, and individuals who planted the largest number of trees. That day, an astounding one million trees were planted in Nebraska—an average of more than six for every man, woman and child in the state.\n于是在1872年4月10日，第一个非官方的植树节在内布拉斯加全境举行。奖项颁给了种树最多的县、市和个人。那一天，内布拉斯加种下了惊人的一百万棵树——平均每个男女老少每人种了六棵多。",
