     "answer": "A（细节题）Help save species from extinction and boost human health.",
     "evidence": "P1\nThe genetic code of all 1.5 million known species of animals and plants living on earth will be mapped to help save species from extinction and boost human health.\n地球上全部 150 万已知动植物物种的基因密码都将被绘制出来，以帮助拯救物种免于灭绝、并提升人类健康。",
