     "stem": "What will you end up doing without pursuing intentional aspirational goals?",
     "stemZh": "如果不追求有意的抱负目标,你最终会做什么?\nA) 漫无目的地度过一生。\nB) 放弃实现自我的机会。\nC) 放弃生活所提供的一切。\nD) 毁坏你的品格和正直。",
     "answer": "A（细节题）Drifting through life aimlessly.",
     "evidence": "P4\nIf you have nothing to strive for, you're putting yourself in the dangerous position of simply drifting through life, and you will not be able to experience, live and enjoy all that life has to offer.\n如果你没有什么可为之奋斗的，你就把自己置于一个危险的境地——只是漫无目的地随波逐流地过一生，而且你将无法去体验、去活出、去享受生活所能给予的一切。",
     "signal": "文末 dangerous position 的警示结论。原文 you're putting yourself in the dangerous position of simply drifting through life 用 dangerous 加重语气点出\"危险结局\"，是文末收束的警示落点。",
     "sub": "simply drifting through life↔Drifting through life aimlesslysimply=aimlessly 同义改写",
     "exclude": "B)未提及Giving up the chance to fulfill yourself. 说\"放弃自我实现的机会\"，原文文末讲的是\"漂泊度日、无法享受生活\"，并未提到\"放弃自我实现\"，属未提及。\nC)原词陷阱Abandoning all that life has to offer. 直接借了原文 all that life has to offer 来诱选，但原文是说你\"将无法享受 all that life has to offer\"，是\"无法享受\"而非主动\"abandon（抛弃）\"，意思错位。\n借用原文：enjoy all that life has to offer\nD)张冠李戴Spoiling your character and integrity. 借了第 3 段 character, integrity, and trustworthiness 的词，但那处讲的是\"目标应包含做有品格的人\"这一正面主张，不是\"不追目标会毁品格\"的结局，张冠李戴到本题。\n借用原文：a person of \"good\" character, integrity, and trustworthiness",
